{"slug":"acis+and+galatea","title":"Acis and Galatea","composer":"Georg Friedrich Haendel","source":"opera-guide.ch","source_url":"https://opera-guide.ch/operas/acis+and+galatea/","librettist":"John Gay, Alexander Pope und John Hughes,, nach Ovids Metamorphosen","premiere":"Sommer 1718, Cannons (Edgware)","place":"Am Fusse des Ätna, in arkadischen Gefilden","time":"Mythische Antike","roles":["ACIS (Tenor)","GALATHEA (Sopran)","DAMON (Tenor oder Sopran)","POLYPHEMUS (Bass)","CHOR","Hirten und Nymphen"],"synopses":{},"librettos":{"de":{"language":"German","title":"Personen: ACIS (Tenor) GALATHEA (Sopran) DAMON (Tenor oder Sopran) POLYPHEMUS (Bass) CHOR Hirten und Nymphen","source_url":"https://opera-guide.ch/operas/acis+and+galatea/libretto/de/","acts":[{"heading":"Act","scenes":[{"title":"","description":"","lines":[["","EINZIGER AKT","dir"],["","Eine ländliche Gegend mit Felsen, Baumgruppen und einem Flusse. Acis und Galatea, bei einer Quelle gelagert; Chor der Nymphen und Schäfer, über die Landschaft zerstreut; und Polyphemus, auf einem Berge sitzend","dir"],["","Nr. 1 - Sinfonia","dir"],["","Nr. 2 - Chor","dir"],["CHOR","O! den Fluren sei der Preis!","sung"],["CHOR","Sang und Tanz in frohem Kreis,","sung"],["CHOR","Fröhlich, selig, frisch und frei,","sung"],["CHOR","Spielt und lacht den Tag vorbei.","sung"],["CHOR","Für uns erglänzt die Au',","sung"],["CHOR","Für uns bereift vom Tau,","sung"],["CHOR","Für uns versüsst die Luft","sung"],["CHOR","Der Rose frischer Duft.","sung"],["CHOR","Uns freut der Horen Tanz,","sung"],["CHOR","Uns lacht des Sommers Glanz,","sung"],["CHOR","Des Lenzes milder Schein,","sung"],["CHOR","Des Herbstes Frucht und Wein.","sung"],["CHOR","O! den Fluren sei der Preis!","sung"],["CHOR","Sang und Tanz in frohem Kreis,","sung"],["CHOR","Fröhlich, selig, frisch und frei,","sung"],["CHOR","Spielt und lacht den Tag vorbei.","sung"],["","Nr. 3 - Rezitativ und Arie","dir"],["GALATHEA","Du dunkler Hain, du farb'ge Fläche!","sung"],["GALATHEA","Sprudelquell und Perlenbäche,","sung"],["GALATHEA","Du bunte Herrlichkeit der Au'n,","sung"],["GALATHEA","Reizlos ist mir dein Reiz zu schau'n;","sung"],["GALATHEA","Zu machtlos, zu stillen trüben Muth,","sung"],["GALATHEA","Der Sehnsucht Qual, der Liebe Glut.","sung"],["GALATHEA","Fort, du süsser Sängerchor!","sung"],["GALATHEA","Dein schmetternd Lied","sung"],["GALATHEA","Ruft im Gemüt","sung"],["GALATHEA","Der Liebe Pein hervor.","sung"],["GALATHEA","Stillt den Sang und fort von hier,","sung"],["GALATHEA","Bringt meinen Acis her zu mir!","sung"],["","Nr. 4 - Arie","dir"],["ACIS","Wo find' ich sie, die mir so lieb?","sung"],["ACIS","Geleitet mich, ihr Götter dieser Fluren!","sung"],["ACIS","O sagt mir, wisst ihr, wo sie blieb?","sung"],["ACIS","Saht ihr im Tal, im Walde ihre Spuren?","sung"],["","Nr. 5 - Rezitativ und Arie","dir"],["DAMON","Bleib, Schäfer, bleib!","sung"],["DAMON","Sieh', wie dir dort die Herde irrend streift!","sung"],["DAMON","Was meint dies schwermutsvolle Lied?","sung"],["DAMON","erstummt ist deiner Flöte Spiel.","sung"],["DAMON","Schäfer, lass dein Liebeswerben!","sung"],["DAMON","Achtlos suchst du dein Verderben;","sung"],["DAMON","Bleib bei uns und unserm Tanz.","sung"],["DAMON","Spar' dein Leiden dir auf morgen,","sung"],["DAMON","Heute halt' dich frei von Sorgen,","sung"],["DAMON","Frei von Kummer gar und ganz.","sung"],["","Nr. 6 - Rezitativ und Arie","dir"],["ACIS","O, seht sie dort! o Galathea, blicke her zu mir:","sung"],["ACIS","Sieh', wie vor dir dein treuer Acis kniet!","sung"],["ACIS","Liebe sitzt gaukelnd ihr im Aug'","sung"],["ACIS","Und strahlet tödliche Lust;","sung"],["ACIS","Liebe sitzt schaukelnd auf ihrer Brust","sung"],["ACIS","Und singend in ihrem Hauch!","sung"],["ACIS","Liebe umstrahlt mit Anmut","sung"],["ACIS","Der holden Lippen Reiz;","sung"],["ACIS","Es wallt, es wogt ihr Busen","sung"],["ACIS","Vom Sehnen süssen Leid's.","sung"],["","Nr. 7 - Rezitativ und Arie","dir"],["GALATHEA","O! kenntest du die Qual einsamer Liebe,","sung"],["GALATHEA","Du weiltest nie von Galathea fern.","sung"],["GALATHEA","So wie die Taube","sung"],["GALATHEA","In einsamer Laube","sung"],["GALATHEA","Nach ihrem Trauten klagt:","sung"],["GALATHEA","Kehrt er zurück,","sung"],["GALATHEA","Ist sie voll Glück","sung"],["GALATHEA","Und kos't so lang' es tagt.","sung"],["GALATHEA","Wohlig Kirren,","sung"],["GALATHEA","Wonnig Girren","sung"],["GALATHEA","Ruft noch summend durch die Nacht,","sung"],["GALATHEA","Summend durch die Ruh' der Nacht.","sung"],["","Nr. 8 - Duett","dir"],["GALATHEA UND ACIS","Selig wir!","sung"],["GALATHEA","Wie glänzt dein Aug'!","sung"],["ACIS","Wie strahlt dein Reiz!","sung"],["GALATHEA","Aller Knaben Liebster du!","sung"],["ACIS","Aller Nymphen Schönste du!","sung"],["BEIDE","Du all mein Heil, du all mein Glück!","sung"],["BEIDE","Selig wir!","sung"],["","Nr. 9 - Chor","dir"],["CHOR","Selig wir!","sung"],["CHOR","Wie glänzt sein Aug', wie strahlt ihr Reiz!","sung"],["CHOR","Selig wir!","sung"],["","Nr. 10 - Chor","dir"],["CHOR","Armes Paar! ach, hart Geschick,","sung"],["CHOR","Das euch bedroht! unstetes Glück!","sung"],["CHOR","Armes Paar! ach, eitler Wahn!","sung"],["CHOR","O seht das ungeheuer nah'n!","sung"],["CHOR","Seht, wie mächt'gen Schritts er strebt!","sung"],["CHOR","Der Berg erdröhnt, der Wald erbebt;","sung"],["CHOR","Es flieht die Welle, die bang zum Strande prallt:","sung"],["CHOR","Horch, wie sein Donnerruf erschallt!","sung"],["","Nr. 11 - Rezitativ","dir"],["POLYPHEMUS","O Schmach - o Wut - o Scham - o Glut!","sung"],["POLYPHEMUS","Der schmächt'ge Gott hat mir das Herz durchbohrt.","sung"],["POLYPHEMUS","Du treue Pinie,","sung"],["POLYPHEMUS","Du meiner Schritte Stab, hinweg mit dir!","sung"],["POLYPHEMUS","Bringt mir ein hundert Rohre gross und weit","sung"],["POLYPHEMUS","Zum Flötenspiel für meinen mächt'gen Hauch;","sung"],["POLYPHEMUS","Und sanft in Zaubertönen sing' ich ihr,","sung"],["POLYPHEMUS","Der süssen Galathea, meinen Preis.","sung"],["","Nr. 12 - Arie","dir"],["POLYPHEMUS","O rosig wie die Pfirsche,","sung"],["POLYPHEMUS","O süsser als die Kirsche,","sung"],["POLYPHEMUS","O Nymphe, klar","sung"],["POLYPHEMUS","Wie Mondscheinnacht,","sung"],["POLYPHEMUS","Flink wie die schlanken Hirsche!","sung"],["POLYPHEMUS","Reif wie die vollen Trauben","sung"],["POLYPHEMUS","Und munter wie die Tauben;","sung"],["POLYPHEMUS","Doch ungezähmt","sung"],["POLYPHEMUS","Wie Flammenglut,","sung"],["POLYPHEMUS","Und wild wie Sturmesschnauben.","sung"],["","Nr. 13 - Rezitativ","dir"],["POLYPHEMUS","Warum, Schönste, willst du fliehen,","sung"],["POLYPHEMUS","Meinen Armen dich entziehen?","sung"],["GALATHEA","Ja, läd't zu seinem Mahl der Leu,","sung"],["GALATHEA","So flieht das Lamm in kluger Scheu.","sung"],["POLYPHEMUS","Sieh', Polyphemus, gross wie Zeus,","sung"],["POLYPHEMUS","Weihet Liebe dir und Preis,","sung"],["POLYPHEMUS","Läd't zu seinem Felspalast,","sung"],["POLYPHEMUS","Seiner Herde dich zu Gast,","sung"],["POLYPHEMUS","Zu der Traube süssem Blut,","sung"],["POLYPHEMUS","Zu der Pflaume dunkler Glut,","sung"],["POLYPHEMUS","Äpfeln, die erwartend stehn,","sung"],["POLYPHEMUS","Sich von dir gepflückt zu sehn.","sung"],["GALATHEA","Zur rohen Kost bei deinem Mahle,","sung"],["GALATHEA","Zu Menschenblut aus deiner Schale!","sung"],["GALATHEA","Geh'! lad' dir einen andern Gast:","sung"],["GALATHEA","Mir ist so Wirth, wie Fest verhasst.","sung"],["","Nr. 14 - Arie","dir"],["POLYPHEMUS","Treffe Fluch dies Liebesschmachten,","sung"],["POLYPHEMUS","All mein Blut wallt in Empörung!","sung"],["POLYPHEMUS","Nur nach Rache sei mein Trachten,","sung"],["POLYPHEMUS","Nur nach Rache und Zerstörung.","sung"],["","Nr. 15 - Arie","dir"],["DAMON","Willst du dir die Nymphe gewinnen,","sung"],["DAMON","Sei gut und freundlich all dein Beginnen:","sung"],["DAMON","Leiden ist der Liebe Loos.","sung"],["DAMON","Schönheit mit Gewalt bezwingen,","sung"],["DAMON","Kann nur halbes Heil dir bringen,","sung"],["DAMON","Lebenlos und liebelos.","sung"],["","Nr. 16 - Rezitativ und Arie","dir"],["ACIS","Das Ungetüm weckt meine Wut:","sung"],["ACIS","Schwach wie ich bin, ich fass' ihn an!","sung"],["ACIS","Entflammt bin ich von deinem Reiz,","sung"],["ACIS","Der Liebe Gott verleiht mir Kraft.","sung"],["ACIS","Lass mich zum Kampf,","sung"],["ACIS","Und wär's mein Verderben!","sung"],["ACIS","Ist Schönheit der Preis,","sung"],["ACIS","Wer fürchtet zu sterben?","sung"],["ACIS","Dich im Sieg zu erwerben,","sung"],["ACIS","Wie glüht mir der Muth,","sung"],["ACIS","Im Kampf dich zu schirmen","sung"],["ACIS","Mit Leben und Blut.","sung"],["","Nr. 17 - Arie","dir"],["DAMON","Bedenke, o Knabe,","sung"],["DAMON","Wie flüchtig der Reiz ist,","sung"],["DAMON","Zu schmeicheln dem Wahn,","sung"],["DAMON","Der nach Liebe sich sehnt!","sung"],["DAMON","Die Freuden der Liebe","sung"],["DAMON","Sie rauschen vorüber,","sung"],["DAMON","Ihr Leiden ist lang,","sung"],["DAMON","Wie das Leben sich dehnt.","sung"],["","Nr. 18 - Rezitativ","dir"],["GALATHEA","Bleib, o bleib, mein süsser Freund,","sung"],["GALATHEA","Trau' auf meine Lieb' und Treu',","sung"],["GALATHEA","Meine Treu' und jene Macht,","sung"],["GALATHEA","Die über treue Liebe wacht!","sung"],["","Nr. 19 - Terzett","dir"],["ACIS UND GALATHEA","Dem Berge mag die Herde,","sung"],["ACIS UND GALATHEA","Dem Wald die Turteltaube,","sung"],["ACIS UND GALATHEA","Dem Quell die Nymph' entsagen,","sung"],["ACIS UND GALATHEA","Doch ich der Liebe nie!","sung"],["POLYPHEMUS","Rache! Rache! Wut! o Grimm!","sung"],["POLYPHEMUS","Ich trag' es länger nicht!","sung"],["ACIS UND GALATHEA","Der Tag ist nicht der Biene,","sung"],["ACIS UND GALATHEA","Die Nacht der Nachtigall","sung"],["ACIS UND GALATHEA","So hold nicht und so lieblich,","sung"],["ACIS UND GALATHEA","Wie dieses Lächeln mir.","sung"],["POLYPHEMUS","Flieg' aus, geflügeltes Geschoss!","sung"],["POLYPHEMUS","Stirb, verruchter Acis, stirb!","sung"],["","Nr. 20 - Rezitativ","dir"],["ACIS","Hilf, Galathea! helft, ihr Götter all'!","sung"],["ACIS","O nehmt mich Toten auf in euer Haus.","sung"],["","Nr. 21 - Chor","dir"],["CHOR","Klagt all' ihr Musen! wein' alles Volk!","sung"],["CHOR","Stimmt euren Sang zum Jammerruf!","sung"],["CHOR","Klagt, klagt, und Wehgeschrei erfüll' die Luft:","sung"],["CHOR","Ach, der holde Acis ist nicht mehr!","sung"],["","Nr. 22 - Galathea und Chor","dir"],["GALATHEA","O, ist mein Acis nun dahin,","sung"],["GALATHEA","Vom Felsgeschoss zerschmettert mir!","sung"],["CHOR","Ach, Galathea, weine nicht!","sung"],["CHOR","Beklag' nicht den du kannst befrei'n.","sung"],["GALATHEA","Ist der holde Knabe tot,","sung"],["GALATHEA","Weil er so treu, so lieb mir war?","sung"],["CHOR","Ach, Galathea, weine nicht!","sung"],["CHOR","Beklag' nicht den du kannst befrei'n;","sung"],["CHOR","Sprich über ihn dein Zauberwort,","sung"],["CHOR","Die Göttin heilet leicht den Schmerz.","sung"],["GALATHEA","Sage, welchen Trost du meinst?","sung"],["GALATHEA","Denn dunkle Verzweiflung überschattet mich.","sung"],["CHOR","Verwandten Göttern mach' ihn gleich,","sung"],["CHOR","Zum Silberquell verwandle ihn,","sung"],["CHOR","Und unser Tal nun sei sein Reich.","sung"],["","Nr. 23 - Rezitativ und Arie","dir"],["GALATHEA","So sei's: so üb' ich meine Zaubermacht;","sung"],["GALATHEA","Sei du unsterblich, bist du auch nicht mein!","sung"],["GALATHEA","Herz, der Liebe süsser Born,","sung"],["GALATHEA","Sei fortan ein Silberquell!","sung"],["GALATHEA","Purpur sei nicht mehr dein Blut,","sung"],["GALATHEA","Gleite gleich krystall'ner Flut.","sung"],["GALATHEA","Fels, entschliess' den dunkeln Schoss!","sung"],["GALATHEA","Der Sprudelquell, sieh'! er strömt;","sung"],["GALATHEA","Und er rauscht das Tal entlang,","sung"],["GALATHEA","Murmelnd seinen Liebessang.","sung"],["","Nr. 24 - Chor","dir"],["CHOR","Galathea, stille den Schmerz,","sung"],["CHOR","Acis ward zum Gotte nun!","sung"],["CHOR","Sieh', er erhebt sich auf vom Bett,","sung"],["CHOR","Sieh', ihm umschlingt ein Kranz das Haupt.","sung"],["CHOR","Heil dir, holder rauschender Strom,","sung"],["CHOR","Hirtenfreude, Musenlust!","sung"],["CHOR","Ströme fort das Tal entlang,","sung"],["CHOR","Murmelnd deinen Liebessang.","sung"]]}]}]},"en":{"language":"English","title":"Cast: GALATEA (soprano) ACIS (tenor) DAMON (tenor) POLYPHEMUS (bass) CHORUS of Shepherds and Shepherdesses","source_url":"https://opera-guide.ch/operas/acis+and+galatea/libretto/en/","acts":[{"heading":"Act","scenes":[{"title":"","description":"","lines":[["","PART I","dir"],["","1 - Sinfonia","dir"],["","2 - Chorus","dir"],["CHORUS","Oh, the pleasure of the plains!","sung"],["CHORUS","Happy nymphs and happy swains,","sung"],["CHORUS","Harmless, merry, free and gay,","sung"],["CHORUS","Dance and sport the hours away.","sung"],["CHORUS","For us the zephyr blows,","sung"],["CHORUS","For us distills the dew,","sung"],["CHORUS","For us unfolds the rose,","sung"],["CHORUS","And flow'rs display their hue.","sung"],["CHORUS","For us the winters rain,","sung"],["CHORUS","For us the summers shine,","sung"],["CHORUS","Spring swells for us the grain,","sung"],["CHORUS","And autumn bleeds the wine.","sung"],["CHORUS","Oh, the pleasure … (da capo)","sung"],["","3 - Accompagnato","dir"],["GALATEA","Ye verdant plains and woody mountains,","sung"],["GALATEA","Purling streams and bubbling fountains,","sung"],["GALATEA","Ye painted glories of the field,","sung"],["GALATEA","Vain are the pleasures which ye yield;","sung"],["GALATEA","Too thin the shadow of the grove,","sung"],["GALATEA","Too faint the gales, to cool my love.","sung"],["","4 - Air","dir"],["GALATEA","Hush, ye pretty warbling quire!","sung"],["GALATEA","Your thrilling strains","sung"],["GALATEA","Awake my pains,","sung"],["GALATEA","And kindle fierce desire.","sung"],["GALATEA","Cease your song, and take your flight,","sung"],["GALATEA","Bring back my Acis to my sight!","sung"],["GALATEA","Hush … (da capo)","sung"],["","5 - Air","dir"],["ACIS","Where shall I seek the charming fair?","sung"],["ACIS","Direct the way, kind genius of the mountains!","sung"],["ACIS","O tell me, if you saw my dear!","sung"],["ACIS","Seeks she the grove, or bathes in crystal fountains?","sung"],["ACIS","Where … (da capo)","sung"],["","6 - Recitative","dir"],["DAMON","Stay, shepherd, stay!","sung"],["DAMON","See, how thy flocks in yonder valley stray!","sung"],["DAMON","What means this melancholy air?","sung"],["DAMON","No more thy tuneful pipe we hear.","sung"],["","7 - Air","dir"],["DAMON","Shepherd, what art thou pursuing?","sung"],["DAMON","Heedless running to thy ruin;","sung"],["DAMON","Share our joy, our pleasure share,","sung"],["DAMON","Leave thy passion till tomorrow,","sung"],["DAMON","Let the day be free from sorrow,","sung"],["DAMON","Free from love, and free from care!","sung"],["DAMON","Shepherd … (da capo)","sung"],["","8 - Recitative","dir"],["ACIS","Lo, here my love, turn, Galatea, hither turn thy eyes!","sung"],["ACIS","See, at thy feet the longing Acis lies.","sung"],["","9 - Air","dir"],["ACIS","Love in her eyes sits playing,","sung"],["ACIS","And sheds delicious death;","sung"],["ACIS","Love on her lips is straying,","sung"],["ACIS","And warbling in her breath!","sung"],["ACIS","Love on her breast sits panting","sung"],["ACIS","And swells with soft desire;","sung"],["ACIS","No grace, no charm is wanting,","sung"],["ACIS","To set the heart on fire.","sung"],["ACIS","Love in her eyes … (da capo)","sung"],["","10 - Recitative","dir"],["GALATEA","Oh, didst thou know the pains of absent love,","sung"],["GALATEA","Acis would ne'er from Galatea rove.","sung"],["","11 - Air","dir"],["GALATEA","As when the dove","sung"],["GALATEA","Laments her love,","sung"],["GALATEA","All on the naked spray;","sung"],["GALATEA","When he returns,","sung"],["GALATEA","No more she mourns,","sung"],["GALATEA","But loves the live-long day.","sung"],["GALATEA","Billing, cooing,","sung"],["GALATEA","Panting, wooing,","sung"],["GALATEA","Melting murmurs fill the grove,","sung"],["GALATEA","Melting murmurs, last